      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "存款人应在注册地或住所地开立银行结算账户。符合本办法规定可以在异地(跨省、市、县)开立银行结算账户的除外。",
      "quoteHash": "27feabfc4755c75b2a018f6fb08c80e915eed32f2d95eb1d8c1f9c82b2979f83",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-f4432e16",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0007",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "存款人可以自主选择银行开立银行结算账户。除国家法律、行政法规和国务院规定外，任何单位和个人不得强令存款人到指定银行开立银行结算账户。",
      "quoteHash": "f4432e16e31a41729146d4a42e735b0dbb2c6d98c045bcda52b44fd82826237d",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
