      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-5e019de6",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0015",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "个人银行结算账户是自然人因投资、消费、结算等而开立的可办理支付结算业务的存款账户。有下列情况的，可以申请开立个人银行结算账户：",
      "quoteHash": "5e019de60db680e10387becd793771167d37d214edf72e3f7e3756cc443796de",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-8daeb469",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0018",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "存款人申请开立一般存款账户，应向银行出具其开立基本存款账户规定的证明文件、基本存款账户开户登记证和下列证明文件：",
      "quoteHash": "8daeb46934d3c516a522f6e37e6ac0455608963561c4679ff527f7b8c08d13f5",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
