      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-61525f04",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0026",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "存款人申请开立单位银行结算账户时，可由法定代表人或单位负责人直接办理，也可授权他人办理。",
      "quoteHash": "61525f048b612b2aba10551b9bb5995922c078ae9314ae2803b80df573c43075",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-a60a5c56",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0027",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "存款人申请开立银行结算账户时，应填制开户申请书。开户申请书按照中国人民银行的规定记载有关事项。",
      "quoteHash": "a60a5c562e0901f4ff92a2f26c4ebd801d59d728f2b8348cd9b9096876824df0",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-cbac73ca",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0028",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行应对存款人的开户申请书填写的事项和证明文件的真实性、完整性、合规性进行认真审查。",
      "quoteHash": "cbac73cad666c59ad4e452b48c99a93a465a57f5a61389ef3ae578da483aeff0",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-ee8b3fed",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0029",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "中国人民银行应于 2 个工作日内对银行报送的基本存款账户、临时存款账户和预算单位专用存款账户的开户资料的合规性予以审核，符合开户条件的，予以核准；不符合开户条件的，应在开户申请书上签署意见，连同有关证明文件一并退回报送银行。",
      "quoteHash": "ee8b3fed98090ca971b4d9967350ed038bb2f20eaeb288a5803a54f6e1c7a9bd",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-d604e610",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0030",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行为存款人开立银行结算账户，应与存款人签订银行结算账户管理协议，明确双方的权利与义务。除中国人民银行另有规定的以外，应建立存款人预留签章卡片，并将签章式样和有关证明文件的原件或复印件留存归档。",
      "quoteHash": "d604e6102051b1fdc9be662cbb8fa190ad22116e8849362e3862adf87b4b1e4e",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-a16b9be8",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0031",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "开户登记证是记载单位银行结算账户信息的有效证明，存款人应按本办法的规定使用，并妥善保管。",
      "quoteHash": "a16b9be8bb515df2daaf78be662285e5c66fc95fb60bcafdccedb309bf730c7f",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-122c537a",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0033",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "基本存款账户是存款人的主办账户。存款人日常经营活动的资金收付及其工资、奖金和现金的支取，应通过该账户办理。",
      "quoteHash": "122c537a1bc8c631c711fa3032ebe8daf9741fe80b7f8cc13280d9b5e057fc91",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
