      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0036",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "临时存款账户用于办理临时机构以及存款人临时经营活动发生的资金收付。",
      "quoteHash": "e8b61517614111c2be5b171062a3eb4989ebb68a7ddfb5ae634f575b67bf05d3",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-d6c57e52",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0038",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "存款人开立单位银行结算账户，自正式开立之日起 3 个工作日后，方可办理付款业务。但注册验资的临时存款账户转为基本存款账户和因借款转存开立的一般存款账户除外。",
      "quoteHash": "d6c57e524c10fb447fa5e205bd8376f4e5a47b29ed7664da66a38c62279c1a08",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-a39a3efc",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0039",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "个人银行结算账户用于办理个人转账收付和现金存取。下列款项可以转入个人银行结算账户：",
      "quoteHash": "a39a3efc88fe88c0f10c318d53f336e8c25f381572f6086da9515127ed73e7ef",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-f2163560",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0041",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "有下列情形之一的，个人应出具本办法第四十条规定的有关收款依据。",
      "quoteHash": "f2163560335009ef9a939f72e82b015b9bf8075a5ad0ff5e54109aba2329d8b8",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-281f7c5a",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0042",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "单位银行结算账户支付给个人银行结算账户款项的，银行应按第四十条、第四十一条规定认真审查付款依据或收款依据的原件，并留存复印件，按会计档案保管。未提供相关依据或相关依据不符合规定的，银行应拒绝办理。",
      "quoteHash": "281f7c5a8adda86e43375d52dd1ff372ba2c193df6ed141cdadb1ded0c38f1d2",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-7c001b23",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0043",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "储蓄账户仅限于办理现金存取业务，不得办理转账结算。",
      "quoteHash": "7c001b2389a10cd0cbea87a2f517f9d230ba55eaf51ae0db8a5ae9cee10228c9",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-10787611",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0044",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四十四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行应按规定与存款人核对账务。银行结算账户的存款人收到对账单或对账信息后，应及时核对账务并在规定期限内向银行发出对账回单或确认信息。",
      "quoteHash": "1078761178393fa34ec20be63c2370feb106c15445ea8fdd52b790780f583ff1",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-ba384794",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0045",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四十五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "存款人应按照本办法的规定使用银行结算账户办理结算业务。",
      "quoteHash": "ba384794056c3cf40bb4ee31d7d227c9f35757a122e91ba0cf92dff775fde249",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-35bae343",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0048",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行接到存款人的变更通知后，应及时办理变更手续，并于 2 个工作日内向中国人民银行报告。",
      "quoteHash": "35bae34319b0752e7c4ce3fdd685f956065bca07a346cfc097e1dfac4fba5495",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-624ae168",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0050",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "存款人因本办法第四十九条第一、二项原因撤销基本存款账户的，存款人基本存款账户的开户银行应自撤销银行结算账户之日起 2 个工作日内将撤销该基本存款账户的情况书面通知该存款人其他银行结算账户的开户银行；存款人其他银行结算账户的开户银行，应自收到通知之日起 2 个工作日内通知存款人撤销有关银行结算账户；存款人应自收到通知之日起 3 个工作日内办理其他银行结算账户的撤销。",
      "quoteHash": "624ae168c0af5ebd1fb351cbffc2ce6f1a2a1f534069e80d907dcdcb46679ee9",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-0290d4b6",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0051",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行得知存款人有本办法第四十九条第一、二项情况，存款人超过规定期限未主动办理撤销银行结算账户手续的，银行有权停止其银行结算账户的对外支付。",
      "quoteHash": "0290d4b606dec2d9fdc06c82b87e515ffd4212d2bd209f170c0029d989ca6fa6",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-71855351",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0054",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五十四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "存款人撤销银行结算账户，必须与开户银行核对银行结算账户存款余额，交回各种重要空白票据及结算凭证和开户登记证，银行核对无误后方可办理销户手续。存款人未按规定交回各种重要空白票据及结算凭证的，应出具有关证明，造成损失的，由其自行承担。",
      "quoteHash": "718553510bf7a12bdf18fa3ea68c2b0d373d9f22c795358625aa1d6ae33341b9",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-453cdab8",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0056",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行对一年未发生收付活动且未欠开户银行债务的单位银行结算账户,应通知单位自发出通知之日起 30 日内办理销户手续，逾期视同自愿销户，未划转款项列入久悬未取专户管理。",
      "quoteHash": "453cdab8794a47cf67e03fc05d31d17197593ccd07add635cd0d5722ab9c4569",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-d21a984a",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0057",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五十七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "中国人民银行负责监督、检查银行结算账户的开立和使用，对存款人、银行违反银行结算账户管理规定的行为予以处罚。",
      "quoteHash": "d21a984aac845129f2be2fe79df93663f233201f7785858189e7a95ee61575e8",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-a6100f3b",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0061",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第六十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行应明确专人负责银行结算账户的开立、使用和撤销的审查和管理，负责对存款人开户申请资料的审查，并按照本办法的规定及时报送存款人开销户信息资料，建立健全开销户登记制度，建立银行结算账户管理档案，按会计档案进行管理。",
      "quoteHash": "a6100f3b6e4403c961622851adb8ca17f0dc1d814f1e64444d6f73c6efae59c9",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-8c161427",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0062",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第六十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行应对已开立的单位银行结算账户实行年检制度，检查开立的银行结算账户的合规性，核实开户资料的真实性；对不符合本办法规定开立的单位银行结算账户，应予以撤销。对经核实的各类银行结算账户的资料变动情况，应及时报告中国人民银行当地分支行。",
      "quoteHash": "8c161427b0b7691486d491d8f8679fe3b1b8a10cd315c3f8ae77e174c4515a40",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "70856944765f2ae2192414d2714e1c42bd036ceedd83c80ef4ddbeefa98d1654",
      "sourceId": "REG-CM-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-CM-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGCM002-20260922-70856944",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGCM002-016efede",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGCM002-0063",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第六十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "存款人应加强对预留银行签章的管理。单位遗失预留公章或财务专用章的，应向开户银行出具书面申请、开户登记证、营业执照等相关证明文件；更换预留公章或财务专用章时，应向开户银行出具书面申请、原预留签章的式样等相关证明文件。个人遗失或更换预留个人印章或更换签字人时，应向开户银行出具书面申请、原预留印章或签字人的个人身份证件。银行应留存相应的复印件，并凭以办理预留银行签章的变更。",
      "quoteHash": "016efedec8bcc9e28dbafd426be82f9a7c2d38a069acb1392fc58d76f59f19d3",
